<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Piyɛri I</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi singe Annabi Piyɛri naxan sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Piyɛri I</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa masenyi singe</para>
  <para style="mt">Annabi Piyɛri naxan sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Isa xa xɛɛra Piyɛri nan yi Kitaabui sɛbɛ Isayankae ma, naxee nu yensenxi yire wuyaxi Rɔma mangɛya bun ma. Na waxati Rɔma nu bara nɔ ɲamanɛ gbegbe ra. Rɔma na ɲamanɛ nɛɛnɛ masɔtɔ, a mu tondima na ɲamanɛ xa a gbe diinɛ rabatu, kɔnɔ a nu wama nɛ na ɲamanɛ xa Rɔma xa kuyee fan batu. Isayankae mu tin na rabade Ala xa sɛriyɛ xa fe ra. E nu a kolon Ala keren nan a ra. Na kui, Rɔma mangasanyi naxa e ɲaxankata a ɲaaxi ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Piyɛri yi Kitaabui sɛbɛxi nɛ, alako a xa Isayankae ralimaniya naxee nu na na tɔɔrɛ mɔɔli kui. A naxa a fala e bɛ a tɔɔrɛ naxan fatanxi fe fanyi rabafe ra, a na mu ɲaaxu, yaagi mu na a kui. A man naxa Isa xa faxɛ masen e bɛ misaali ra, alako e xa a kolon Alatala na e sɛɛti ma e xa tɔɔrɛ kui, a man fama nɛ e rakelide faxɛ ma. Na birin nɔma findide limaniya ra Isayanka birin bɛ naxee tɔɔrɔma e xa danxaniya xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Piyɛri fe gbegbe masenma danxaniyatɔɛe bɛ e ɲɛrɛ ki xa fe ra. A won yamarima won xa bira Ala xa sɛniyɛnyi fɔxɔ ra. Xa won findixi Ala fɔxirabirɛe nan na, a lanma won xa ɲɛrɛ a xa kira xɔn ma. Ala xa won mali na kui. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa masenyi singe</para>
  <para style="imte">Annabi Piyɛri naxan sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="cl">Sora</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="s">Xɛɛbui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />N tan Piyɛri, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa xa xɛɛra, n bara wo xɛɛbu yi sɛbɛli ra, wo tan mixi sugandixi naxee yensenxi ɲamanɛe ma alɔ Pontu, Galati, Kapadose, Asi, nun Bitiniya, e findi xɔɲɛe ra dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Baba Ala nu bara wo sugandi kabi a rakuya alɔ a nu wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ. A Xaxili bara wo rasɛniyɛn, alako wo xa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa xui ratinmɛ, wo man xa sɛniyɛn a wuli saabui ra. Ala xa hinnɛ nun bɔɲɛsa xa gbo wo yi ra.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ala xa kisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Tantui na Ala bɛ, won Marigi Isa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Baba. A bara kinikini won ma, a a niya won xa bari a nɛɛnɛ ra Isa xa marakeli saabui ra. A to Isa rakeli faxɛ ma, a naxa a niya won fan xa a kolon kisi na won bɛ yare. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Na kisi findixi kɛ sɛniyɛnxi nan na naxan mu ɲɔnma, naxan mu kanama, naxan nagataxi won bɛ ariyanna kui. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Wo to danxaniyaxi Ala ma, a wo makantama nɛ a sɛnbɛ ra, alako wo xa kisi sɔtɔ, a fama naxan naminide wo ma waxati dɔnxɔɛ.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Na kui, sɛɛwɛ na wo bɛ, hali wo to na tɔɔrɛ mɔɔli birin kui yi saxanyi. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Na fe xɔrɔxɔɛe a niyama nɛ fe ɲaaxi birin xa ba wo xa danxaniya kui, a xa findi danxaniya sabatixi ra. A maniyaxi xɛɛma nan na naxan gbi bama tɛ ra. Wo xa danxaniya tide gbo xɛɛma bɛ. Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa na fa, a wo matɔxɔma nɛ, a wo xun nakelima nɛ, a wo binyama nɛ wo xa danxaniya xa fe ra. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Wo bara Isa xanu, hali wo to mu a toxi. Hali wo to mu a toxi fa, wo lama a ra. Sɛɛwɛ xungbe naxan tagi mu nɔma rabade, a bara gbo yɛ wo yi, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />barima wo bara kisi sɔtɔ, wo xa danxaniya nu wama naxan xɔn.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Namiɲɔnmɛe xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Namiɲɔnmɛe yati nu katama ki fanyi ra na kisi xa fe kolonfe wo naxan sɔtɔxi Ala xa hinnɛ saabui ra. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />E nu wama na kisi fa tɛmui nun a fa ki kolonfe Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Xaxili naxan xa fee masen e bɛ. Na Xaxili naxan nu sabatixi e i, a naxa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa tɔɔrɛ nun a xa xunnakeli masen e bɛ beenun nee xa raba. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Ala a masen nɛ namiɲɔnmɛe bɛ, a e mu nu na xɛɛra ibafe e xa waxati mixie xa bɛ. E nu na a ibafe wo tan nan bɛ. E xɛɛra naxan ibaxi, mixi gbɛtɛe bara na xibaaru fanyi ti wo bɛ Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra, naxan kelixi koore ma. Hali malekɛe yati wama na masenyi kolonfe.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danxaniyatɔɛ xa sɛniyɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Na nan a ra, a lan wo xa wo xaxili yailan fe ma wo naxan nabama, wo xa wo ɲɔxɔ sa wo yɛtɛ xɔn ma, wo xa wo xaxili birin ti Ala xa hinnɛ ra, a naxan fima wo ma Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa fa lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Wo naxa bira wo waxɔnfe ɲaaxi fɔxɔ ra alɔ wo nu a rabama ki naxɛ beenun wo xa Isa kolon. Wo xa wo Baba Ala xui rabatu. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Wo ɲɛrɛ ki xa sɛniyɛn alɔ Ala naxan wo xilixi a sɛniyɛnxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />A sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui, «Wo xa sɛniyɛn, barima n tan sɛniyɛn.» <verse eid="1PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Wo nɛ Ala maxandima, wo a falama a bɛ a wo Baba, Ala naxan mixi birin makiitima a wali ra tinxinyi ra. Na kui, waxati dɔnxɔɛ naxan luxi wo bɛ yi duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari, wo a masen wo ɲɛrɛ ki ma a wo a binyaxi.<verse eid="1PE 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Wo xun mu saraxi se ra naxan kanama alɔ xɛɛma nun gbeti. Ala bara wo ratanga wo babae ɲɛrɛ ki kobi ma. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Wo xunsaraxi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi wuli nan na, naxan baxi sɛrɛxɛ ra, alɔ yɛxɛɛ fanyi lanyuru yo mu na naxan ma. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Ala nu bara a sugandi beenun duniɲa xa daa, kɔnɔ a naxa a masen duniɲa bɛ yi waxati dɔnxɔɛ wo tan nan xa fe ra. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Wo danxaniyaxi Ala ma a tan nan saabui ra, Ala naxan nakeli faxɛ ma, a fa a xun nakeli. Na kui, wo la Ala ra, wo xa wo xaxili ti a ra.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Wo to bira nɔndi fɔxɔ ra, wo bara sɛniyɛn, xanunteya fiixɛ bara lu wo bɔɲɛ ma wo ngaxakerenyie bɛ. Na na a ra wo xa wo bore xanu wo bɔɲɛ birin na. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Wo bara bari a nɛɛnɛ ra Ala xa masenyi saabui ra. Na masenyi misaalixi sansi xɔri nan na, naxan mu kanama abadan. A mu kanama alɔ sansi xɔri boore naxan sama bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Ibunadama misaalixi sansi nan na. A xa nɔrɛ luxi alɔ sansi fugaxi. Sansi tan lisima nɛ, a fuge fa bira, <verse eid="1PE 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />kɔnɔ Marigi xa masenyi tan buma abadan. Na masenyi nan findixi xibaaru fanyi ra naxan ibaxi wo bɛ.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa Ɲama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Wo xa fe ɲaaxi, wule, filankafuiɲa, milanteya, nun xili kanɛ bɛɲin. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Wo xa bira Ala xa masenyi fɔxɔ ra alɔ diyɔrɛ wama xiɲɛ xɔn ki naxɛ. Na nɔma a niyade wo xa kisi xa sabati, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />barima wo bara Ala xa hinnɛ kolon.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Wo wo makɔrɛ Isa ra naxan misaalixi gɛmɛ kɛndɛ ra banxi tima naxan fari. Adamadie bara mɛɛ a ra, kɔnɔ Ala tan na gɛmɛ nan sugandixi barima a rafan a ma ki fanyi ra. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Wo fan misaalixi gɛmɛ kɛndɛe nan na naxee tixi Ala Xaxili xa banxi ra. Wo bara findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ sɛniyɛnxie ra alako wo xa wo bɔɲɛ ba sɛrɛxɛ ra Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa saabui ra. Na nan nafan Ala ma.<verse eid="1PE 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />A sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">«N bara gɛmɛ nde sugandi, naxan tide gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">N a dɔxɔma Siyoni nɛ, a findi tuxui gɛmɛ nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">Naxan lama a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">na kanyi mu yaagima.»<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Wo tan naxee danxaniyaxi, naxee lama a ra a na gɛmɛ sugandixi tide gbo, xunnakeli na wo bɛ. Kɔnɔ yi masenyi sɛbɛxi danxaniyataree nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">«Banxitie mɛɛ gɛmɛ naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">na nan findixi gɛmɛ kɛndɛ ra banxi tuxui ma.»<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />A man masenxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">«Mixie e sanyi radinma na gɛmɛ ra, e fa bira.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">E birama nɛ barima e mu tinma Ala xa masenyi ratinmɛde. Ala bara na ragiri e ma. <verse eid="1PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Kɔnɔ Ala wo bɔnsɔɛ nan sugandixi, a xa findi mangɛ xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra. A wo si rasɛniyɛn, a wo xunsara. A naxa wo ramini dimi kui, wo xa lu a xa nɔrɛ bun ma. A na birin naba nɛ alako wo xa a matɔxɔ duniɲa ma. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Singe wo mu nu findixi si ra, kɔnɔ yakɔsi wo bara findi Ala xa ɲama ra. Singe Ala mu nu kinikinixi wo ma, kɔnɔ yakɔsi a xa kinikini bara kamali wo bɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />N xanuntenyie, wo xa limaniya. Wo naxa bira duniɲa fee fɔxɔ ra, barima nee wo bama Ala xa kira nan xɔn ma. Bekae mu na wo ra. Wo xɔnyi mu na yi duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari xa ra. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Wo xa duniɲa mixie xa tɔɔɲɛgɛ xun nakana wo xa wali fanyi saabui ra, alako e fan xa Ala matɔxɔ lɔxɔɛ dɔnxɔɛ ma.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mangasanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Wo wo yɛtɛ magoro duniɲa mangɛ birin bɛ Marigi xa fe ra. Yaamari soxi e tan nan yi, a findi mangɛ xungbe ra, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />a findi mangɛ xa xɛɛrae ra, alɔ gomina. E fe kobi rabae makiitima, e fe fanyi rabae matɔxɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ala wama nɛ wo xa xaxilitaree dɛ balan wo xa wali fanyi saabui ra. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Wo xa ɲɛrɛ alɔ mixi naxee bara xɔrɛya sɔtɔ, kɔnɔ na xɔrɛya naxa a niya wo xa lu fe ɲaaxi kui. Wo xa findi Ala xa konyie ra. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Wo xa mixi birin binya. Wo xa wo ngaxakerenyie xanu. Wo xa gaaxu Ala ya ra. Wo xa mangɛ xungbe binya.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xa tɔɔrɛ misaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Konyie, wo xa wo yɛtɛ magoro wo marigie bɛ binyɛ kui, hali e findi mixi xa fe maxɔrɔxɔxi ra. Wo naxa mixi fanyie xa gbansan xui ratinmɛ, <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />barima fe fanyi nan a ra tinfe e xa i tɔɔrɔ tinxintareya ra Ala xa fe ra. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Xa wo tɔɔrɛ nde sɔtɔ wo xa wali kobi xa fe ra, fe fanyi mu a ra. Kɔnɔ xa wo tɔɔrɛ nde sɔtɔ wo xa fe fanyi xa fe ra, Ala na kolonma nɛ wo bɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Wo xilixi na nan ma, barima Isa fan tɔɔrɔ nɛ wo bɛ, na fa findi misaali ra wo bɛ wo birama naxan fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />«A mu yunubi raba, a mu wule fala.» <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />E to a konbi, a mu a gbeɲɔxɔ. E to a tɔɔrɔ, a mu wɔyɛn xɔrɔxɔɛ fala. A naxa kiiti so kiitisa tinxinxi yi ra. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />A naxa faxa wuri magalanbuxi ma won ma yunubie xa fe ra, alako won xa fe ɲaaxi lu na, won xa ɲɛrɛ tinxinyi kui. A xa fie nan wo rayalanxi. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Wo nu luxi nɛ alɔ xuruse rabɛɲinxie, kɔnɔ yakɔsi wo bara gbilen wo kantama ma, naxan a ɲɔxɔ saxi wo nii xɔn ma.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Futi xiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Wo tan ginɛe, wo fan xa wo yɛtɛ magoro wo xa mɔrie bɛ, alako wo xa mɔri danxaniyataree xa nɔ danxaniyade wo tan e xa ginɛe wali ki saabui ra, hali wo mu sese fala e bɛ, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />e xa wo xa marasɛniyɛnyi nun yaragaaxui gbansan to.<verse eid="1PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Ginɛe, wo naxa kata wo yɛtɛ rayabude xunmasee ra, alɔ xun dɛnbɛ, tulirasoe xɛɛma daaxi, xa na mu dugi tofanyie. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Ginɛe xa tofanyi xa findi bɔɲɛ fanyi nan na. Tofanyi nan na ki naxan mu kanama. Na nan tide gbo Ala bɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Singe ra ginɛ sɛniyɛnxie nu na ki nɛ. E xaxili nu tixi Ala ra, e e yɛtɛ magoroxi e xa mɔrie bɛ, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />alɔ Sara naxan nu Iburahima xui rabatuma, a nu fa a xili «n marigi». Wo findixi a tan nan bɔnsɔɛ ra, xa wo fe fanyi raba, wo mu tin gaaxui yo xa wo xaxili ya iso.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Wo tan fan, xɛmɛe, wo nun wo xa ginɛe, wo xa lu lanyi kui. Wo xa wo bore fahaamu. Xɛmɛ xa a kolon a a sɛnbɛ gbo a xa ginɛ bɛ. Xɛmɛe xa ginɛe binya barima wo birin nan kɛ keren tongoma, naxan findi kisi ra, Ala naxan fima a xa fonisireya kui. Wo xa wo xa ginɛe binya, alako Ala xa wo xa maxandi suxu.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xanunteya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Wo xa lan wo bore ma, wo xa wo bore fahaamu. Ngaxakerenya xanunteya xa lu wo tagi. Wo kinikini wo bore ma, wo man xa wo yɛtɛ magoro wo bore bɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Wo naxa fe ɲaaxi ɲɔxɔ fe ɲaaxi ra, wo naxa konbi ɲɔxɔ konbi ra. Wo lan nɛ wo xa duba wo bore bɛ, barima wo xilixi na nan ma, alako wo xa dubɛ sɔtɔ kɛ ra. A sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui,<verse eid="1PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />«Naxan wama simaya ɲɔxunmɛ xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">hɛɛri gbo naxan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">na kanyi naxa fe kobi fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">wule naxa mini a dɛ kui.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />A xa gbilen fe ɲaaxi fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">A ɲɛrɛ ki xa fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">A xa bira bɔɲɛsa fɔxɔ ra tunnabɛxi kui,<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />barima Marigi ya tixi tinxintɔɛe nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">a tuli matixi e xa maxandi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">Kɔnɔ, a a kobe rasoxi nɛ fe kobi rabae tan na.»<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawandi tife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Nde nɔma wo tɔɔrɔde xa fe fanyi rabafe bara wo bɔɲɛ suxu? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Hali wo tɔɔrɔ tinxinyi xa fe ra, wo hɛɛri nan sɔtɔma. Wo naxa gaaxu fe ya ra duniɲa mixie gaaxuma naxan ya ra, wo bɔɲɛ naxa ifu. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Kɔnɔ wo xa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi findi wo Marigi ra wo bɔɲɛ kui. Wo xa fata a xa fe tagi rabade mixie bɛ wo laxi wo xa kisi ra fe naxan ma, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />kɔnɔ wo xa na masenyi ti dɔyindɔyin binyɛ kui. Wo xa na raba bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra alako wo yaxui naxee wo tɔɔɲɛgɛma Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa fe ra, e xa lu yaagi kui. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Xa Ala a ragirima, a fisa i xa tɔɔrɔ fe fanyi xa fe ra, dinɛ i xa tɔɔrɔ fe ɲaaxi xa fe ra.<verse eid="1PE 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Isa tinxintɔɛ fan faxa nɛ kerenyi ra tinxintaree xa yunubie xa fe ra, alako a xa wo maso Ala ra. E naxa a fate faxa, kɔnɔ Ala Xaxili naxa a nii ragbilen a ma. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Ala Xaxili siga nɛ kawandi tide mixie bɛ naxee nu na geeli kui laaxira, naxee singe nu bara tondi Ala xui ratinmɛde. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Ala nu na e mamɛfe Annabi Nuha nu kunkui banbanma tɛmui naxɛ. Mixi solomasaxan gbansan nan kisi kunkui kui ye ma. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Na fe bara findi misaali ra danxaniyatɔɛ xunxa fe ra, naxan mixi rakisima yi waxati Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa xa marakeli saabui ra. Na xunxafe ye xɔɔra, a mu nɔxɔɛ bama mixi fate, kɔnɔ a findima natɛ tongoe nan na Ala mabiri. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Isa bara te Ala yirefanyi ma ariyanna. Malekɛe, ɲinnɛe, nun sɛnbɛmae birin na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Kɛɲa masarafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Isa xa tɔɔrɛ duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari, a xa findi misaali ra wo bɛ, naxan a niyama wo xa limaniya. Danxaniyatɔɛ naxan fate ɲaxankatama, na bara yunubi fe lu na. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Na kui, a bara duniɲa waxɔnfe lu na, a xa bira Ala waxɔnfe fɔxɔ ra a xa simaya kui naxan luxi. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Wo tɛmui naxan nabaxi duniɲa waxɔnfe fɔxɔ ra, na bara wasakɛ. Wo bara bu duniɲa fe kobi kui alɔ yɛnɛ rabafe, siisife, xulunyi ɲaaxi, beere minfe, nun kuye batufe, naxan findixi fe ɲaaxi ra. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Duniɲa mixie dɛ bara ixara, barima wo mu birama e fɔxɔ ra sɔnɔn na duniɲa fee rabade. Na kui, e wo xili kanama, <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />kɔnɔ e dɛntɛgɛ sama nɛ kiitisa bɛ, naxan fama mixi baloxie nun faxamixie makiitide. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Na nan a ra, Ala xa xibaaru fanyi naxa iba faxamixie fan bɛ, alako Ala xa e nii rakisi, hali mixie to bara gɛ e fate tan makiitide.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wo bore malife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Lɔxɔ dɔnxɔɛ bara makɔrɛ. Wo xa wo xaxili raxara, wo xa wo yɛtɛ suxu, alako wo xa nɔ Ala maxandide. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />A gbengbenyi wo xa wo bore xanu a fanyi ra, barima xanunteya yunubi gbegbe nan makotoma. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Wo xa wo bore rasɛnɛ bɔɲɛ fanyi ra, hali wo mu a findi wɔyɛn xunxuri ra. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Ala hinnɛxi wo ra ki naxɛ, wo fan xa hinnɛ wo bore ra na ki nɛ, alako wo xa findi Ala xa walikɛ fanyie ra, naxee a xa hinnɛ itaxunma. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Xa mixi wama masenyi nde tife, a xa Ala xa masenyi ti. Xa mixi wama a boore malife, a xa na raba Ala sɛnbɛ ra, alako Ala xa matɔxɔɛ sɔtɔ a xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa saabui ra. Matɔxɔɛ nun sɛnbɛ na a bɛ abadan. Amina.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isayankae xa tɔɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />N xanuntenyie, na ɲaxankatɛ naxa wo tɛrɛnna, wo naxan tofe. Fe nɛɛnɛ mu a ra. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Tɔɔrɔfe alɔ Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi tɔɔrɔ ki naxɛ, na xa findi sɛɛwɛ ra wo bɛ, alako wo man xa ɲɛlɛxin a xa nɔrɛ masen lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Xa e wo konbi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xili xa fe ra, hɛɛri na wo bɛ, barima Ala Xaxili nɔrɔxi na wo ma. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Wo naxa ɲaxankatɛ sɔtɔ nii bafe ma, muɲɛ tife ma, fe kobi rabafe ma, xa na mu a ra naafixiya ma. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Kɔnɔ xa wo ɲaxankatɛ sɔtɔ barima Isayankae nan wo ra, wo naxa yaagi, wo xa Ala matɔxɔ Isayanka xili xa fe ra.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ɲaxankatɛ waxati bara wa fɔlɔfe Ala xa ɲama ma. Xa a fɔlɔ won tan ma, a raɲɔnma danxaniyataree ma di? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />«Xa tinxintɔɛ kisife xɔrɔxɔ, Ala kolontare nun yunubitɔɛ tan luma di?» <verse eid="1PE 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Mixi naxee ɲaxankatama, barima e na Ala waxɔnfe rabafe, e xa e xaxili ti e Daali Mangɛ ra naxan xa lanlanteya mu kanama.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Marasie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Danxaniyatɔɛ kuntigie, n bara wo ralimaniya. Kuntigi nan n fan na alɔ wo tan. N seedeɲɔxɔya bama Isa xa tɔɔrɛ xa fe ra. Isa na fa a xa nɔrɛ masende duniɲa bɛ, n fan a sɔtɔma nɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Wo xa wo ɲɛngi sa Ala xa ɲama xɔn ma naxan na wo xa kantari bun ma, alɔ xuruse kantɛ mɛɛnima a xa gɔɔrɛ ma ki naxɛ. Wo xa danxaniyatɔɛe danxun wo ɲanige ra alɔ Ala wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ. Wo naxa na raba alɔ e na wo karaxan. Wo naxa a raba kɔbiri geeni xa fe ra, wo xa a raba wo bɔɲɛ birin na. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Wo naxa danxaniyatɔɛe yamari a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra, naxee bara taxu wo ra. Wo xa findi misaali ra e bɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Xuruse kantama xungbe na fa, a wo binyama nɔrɛ ra naxan mu masarama.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Fonikee, wo fan xa wo yɛtɛ magoro forie bɛ. Wo xa wo yɛtɛ magoro wo bore bɛ, barima a sɛbɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 5:5">«Ala yɛtɛ igboe gerema nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 5:5">kɔnɔ a hinnɛma yɛtɛ magoree ra.»<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Wo xa wo yɛtɛ magoro Ala sɛnbɛ bun ma, alako a xa wo xa fe ite a waxati.<verse eid="1PE 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Wo xa wo xa kɔntɔfili birin so a yi ra, barima a ɲɛngi sama wo xɔn ma. <verse eid="1PE 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Wo wo ɲɔxɔ sa wo yɛtɛ xɔn ma. Wo naxa yanfa. Wo yaxui Ibulisa na fe birin nabafe alako a xa wo xa fe kana. A luxi alɔ yɛtɛ naxan mixi fenfe a xa a don. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Wo ti a kanke i wo sabatixi ra wo xa danxaniya kui. Wo a kolon a Sentanɛ danxaniyatɔɛ birin tɔɔrɔfe na ki nɛ duniɲa kui. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Wo na gɛ tɔɔrɔde dondoronti, Ala hinnɛnte fama wo xa fe yailande, a wo ralimaniya, a sɛnbɛ so wo yi naxan mu kanama. Ala wo xilixi nɛ a xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa saabui ra wo xa lu a xa nɔrɛ bun ma abadan.<verse eid="1PE 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Sɛnbɛ na Ala nan bɛ abadan. Amina.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲungui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />N bara yi bataaxɛ sɛbɛ wo ma, n ngaxakerenyi duluxɔtɔxi Silasi saabui ra, alako n xa wo ralimaniya, n xa seedeɲɔxɔya ba a wo na Ala xa hinnɛ yati nan bun ma. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Isayanka naxee na Babilɔn, Ala naxee sugandixi alɔ wo tan, nee bara wo xɛɛbu, a nun n ma di Maraki. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Wo wo bore xɛɛbu xanunteya sunbui ra. Ala xa wo bɔɲɛ sa, wo tan naxee na Isa fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>